    "Online hint chosen by status, not by failure kind alone (Zone 3's route). When the control plane is really down, the runtime proxy answers its own 502 MARKETPLACE_PROXY_FAILED envelope, so an http-means-message-only rule would drop the plane-naming hint in exactly the objectui#5504 case. 502/503/504 keep the hint; every other answered status shows the server text alone. The Done-when allows 'a hint chosen by status'.",
